      "side": 1,
      "message": "If I\u0027m following this correctly I think this is a change in behavior ?\n\nBefore : if you pass a template with an empty `matchWifiNetworkKey`, you\u0027d get null and match rule SUBSCRIBER_ID_MATCH_RULE_EXACT. So that would never match any subscriber ID.\n\nAfter : if you pass an template with an empty `matchWifiNetworkKey`, you\u0027ll get an empty array of rules which will match any subscriber ID.",
