      "writtenOn": "2022-12-27T07:04:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Before: if it\u0027s empty, then it passes null to `NetworkTemplate(int, String, String[], String)` and then the constructor will generate an empty array if it\u0027s null (left side, l.326). So eventaully this gets a template with empty mMatchWifiNetworkKeys array and match rule SUBSCRIBER_ID_MATCH_RULE_EXACT.\n\nAfter: if `matchWifiNetworkKeys` is empty then it passes an empty array for `mMatchWifiNetworkKeys`. It matches any wifiNetworkKey but not any subscriberId. Also, l.778 (right side) checks the tempate contains subscriber id so the returned template should contain an non-null mMatchSubscriberIds which means the template only returns true if an identity contains the same subscriber id as the template.",
